            <title>0.102</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:57:31 -0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1792795202</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.102</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>The GitHub pane no longer says the gh CLI is missing when you open Addy from Finder or the Dock. Addy now uses your login shell&#x27;s environment and also checks common install locations like Homebrew. This covers pull requests, GitHub Actions and other GitHub commands.</li>
<li>When you show another Mac&#x27;s workspace, this Mac&#x27;s sidebar project list and panes are now fully hidden. Before, they could show through translucent themes or take clicks. This Mac&#x27;s panes keep running in the background, so switching back is still instant.</li>
<li>Switching back from another Mac returns keyboard focus to the pane you were typing in, if that pane is still visible.</li>
<li>The Ask button on Orchestration task cards now works for tasks that were already on the board when the pane opened. Before, clicking it did nothing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
